 "id": "S16",
 "text": "So how did a change like that get through? The steel fabricator proposed the two-rod detail and prepared the shop drawings. Those drawings went back to the structural engineers, and returned with their review stamp. What was said along the way, including a disputed phone call, became one of the most argued-over questions in engineering ethics. What the investigations made clear is that the connection was never checked against the doubled load.",
